{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16601090","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16601090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1660109001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63BDF485F9345AD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","variant_male_record_index":"218311","variant_female_record_index":"218312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1660109001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>……让达米安去帮忙真的没关系吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63BDF485F9345AD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 다미안이 저 둘을 도와도 되는 걸까요?","variant_male_record_index":"218311","variant_female_record_index":"218312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660109002:0":{"text":"걱정 말게, 라이카. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아발론을 지켜줄 테니까.","source_cn":"别太担心，莱卡小姐。<style=stress><pl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x868131CB799B677F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"걱정 말게, 라이카. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아발론을 지켜줄 테니까.","female":"걱정 말게, 라이카. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 아발론을 지켜줄 테니까.","variant_male_record_index":"218313","variant_female_record_index":"218314","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1660109003:0":{"text":"지금은 축제의 즐거움을 만끽하는 게 더 중요하지. 안 그런가, 인듀어?","source_cn":"眼下还是享受节日的欢乐更要紧。因度厄，你说对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD11182019DE4016","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660109004:0":{"text":"아쉽지만 동의할 수 없겠군요.","source_cn":"恕我无法认同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A0A87F27BD9A63F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660109005:1":{"text":"하아, 또 시작이네! 셀로클랜드의 새로운 지도자는 여전히 지루하고 재미없는 일 중독자라니까!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你们看，萨洛克兰的新领袖真是一个十足的呆子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADEAD7580A05F93F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660109006:1":{"text":"하지만 그런 사람이 믿을만 하죠. 에세일들에게는 오히려 좋은 일이에요.","source_cn":"但越是这样的人越可靠。对于艾塞勒们来说，这是一件好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4642978EB9D4FBF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660109007:0":{"text":"음... 로잔에게 꼭 셀로클랜드에 가서 인듀어 씨께 제대로 배우고 오라고 편지를 써야겠네요.","source_cn":"嗯……下次我给洛桑写信时，一定会记得推荐他去萨洛克兰游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60E9EFC692B56701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660109008:1":{"text":"오, 새로운 친구인가? 좋아, 제대로 대접해 주지.","source_cn":"哦，新朋友！好啊，我会好好招待他的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF16B9CEC768856","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1660109009:1":{"text":"인듀어처럼 어둠 속에서 살아가는 소녀들에게 한 줄기 빛을 전해 줄 수 있을 정도로 미남이었으면 좋겠군. 알다시피 지하의 생활은 정말 따분하거든.","source_cn":"希望他的容貌也能和因度厄媲美，给那些生活在暗无天日之地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2DDEF9322E7FE41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1660109010:1":{"text":"에세일은... 잘생긴 사람을 좋아하나요?","source_cn":"艾塞勒们……都很喜欢长相漂亮的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF5488B9D3B9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1660109011:1":{"text":"물론, 아름다움을 사랑하는 마음은 누구에게나 있지.","source_cn":"当然，爱美之心人皆有之。就像你每次拉弓时总会不自觉地调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A466C281938623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1660109012:1":{"text":"인듀어를 봐. 이렇게 잘생긴 사람이 업무 보고를 하러 오면, 귀찮은 일도 술술 풀릴 것 같은 기분이 든달까?","source_cn":"就像因度厄。像他这样美貌的人来汇报工作，总会让人格外舒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB911D5641502967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1660109013:0":{"text":"오...","source_cn":"噢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4358CD2F52B89B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1660109014:1":{"text":"사리에 님의 말은 신경 쓰지 마십시오. 미적 기준이 극단적인 분이거든요.","source_cn":"别在意沙利叶的话。他对审美的要求比较极端。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7591C574378CD87D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1660109015:1":{"text":"다른 얘기를 하는 게 좋겠군요. 요즘 근위대 일부를 지상으로 보내 훈련시키고 싶은데, 혹시 조언을 얻을 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"还是谈些别的吧。我最近想把一批卫队成员送到地表上进行训...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6B962ACE104D925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1660109016:1":{"text":"...모처럼의 휴가인데 꼭 이렇게 해야 하나?","source_cn":"……好不容易休个假，一定要这样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87AB5D9D84276464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1660109017:1":{"text":"차라리 다른 재미있는 걸 찾아보는 게 어때? 카드 놀이 같은 거 말이야.","source_cn":"不如还是来找点别的乐子吧。打打牌怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E5E18323164155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"괜찮아. 무슨 일이 생기면 내가 해결할게","source_cn":"没关系，出了什么事我来解决","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48A33A5D0827424E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"괜찮아. 무슨 일이 생기면 내가 해결할게","female":"괜찮아. 무슨 일이 생기면 내가 해결할게","variant_male_record_index":"86791","variant_female_record_index":"86792","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"나도 걱정이긴 한데...","source_cn":"我也有点担心……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4516ABAAB544F23A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도 걱정이긴 한데...","female":"나도 걱정이긴 한데...","variant_male_record_index":"86793","variant_female_record_index":"86794","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:2:3":{"text":"조아가 있으니 괜찮을 거야","source_cn":"有祖娅和呼金在，应该还好吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x54582DB533BFF4BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조아가 있으니 괜찮을 거야","female":"조아가 있으니 괜찮을 거야","variant_male_record_index":"86795","variant_female_record_index":"86796","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"사리에","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":3}}